92
00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:45.700
Cela suffit, cherchez la prochaine.

93
00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:54.130
La perte est la perte, Baki.

94
00:08:54.130 --> 00:09:00.000
Hoi !

95
00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.050
Il y a 37 personnes.

96
